        "input": "3\n1 1 1 1\n1 2 3 4\n1 8 2 8",
        "output": "Yes\nNo\nYes",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 111: 12/13=12/131^2/1^3 = 1^2/1^312/13=12/13\nTest Case 222: 12/33≠22/431^2/3^3 \\neq 2^2/4^312/33=22/43\nTest Case 333: 12/23=82/831^2/2^3 =  8^2/8^312/23=82/83"
      }
    ]
